Description: experimental live wallpaper manager for GNOME
 GnomeEngine imports and previews local video wallpapers and controls an
 external GStreamer renderer. Desktop placement uses an experimental GNOME
 Shell/Mutter bridge and requires GNOME Shell 50 or newer with the
 GnomeEngine Shell extension enabled. Integration is not yet fully
 runtime-validated on the target session.
